        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize the memutils module. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>memutils_init initializes the print_memory_usage and memutils_initialized module variables when called. This configures if <ref refid="group__memutils__mod_1ga3333e249d12f33dbf81cccac0edd9860" kindref="member">print_memuse_stats()</ref> should print the memory statistics when called. memutils_init, at present, can be called multiple times, and potentially change the behavior of <ref refid="group__memutils__mod_1ga3333e249d12f33dbf81cccac0edd9860" kindref="member">print_memuse_stats()</ref>.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>print_flag</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Indicate if memory statistics should be printed by default </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
