    <briefdescription>
<para>Module to expose the memory printing API. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>V. Balaji</para></simplesect>
Module to expose the memory printing API</para><para>Model components at times desire to print the memory statics to stderr, or another file (e.g. the log file). This can be useful in debugging. This module exposes the print_memuse_stat and memutils_init calls for use in external user code. </para>    </detaileddescription>
